# Freeholders: human settlers who build with whatever survived the trip. Boarded walls patched
# with big sheets, timber, corrugated roofs on stepped gables, tungsten bulbs. Two module sets:
# "farm" for homesteads and "mine" for their timbered drift mines.

kit freeholder
name Freeholders
faction freeholders
light ffcf7a

panels 6 3 0.3
facade 5a5048 4a3a2a c9a227

palette
  #  cube     scrap     7a5a3a|5c6e68|947a42|6e6a5e          wall    boards, patched in big sheets
  %  cube     timber    7a5a3a|72543a                       wall    timber boards
  n  cube     timber    a3402a|8f3524                       wall    barn red
  q  cube     concrete  6a625a|5f5850                       wall    poured concrete
  _  cube     concrete  5a5048|625850                       floor
  =  cube     scrap     6a4a32|7a3e26|5d6b5f|8a7a4a         roof    corrugated patches
  *  cube     lumen     ffcf7a                              light   tungsten bulbs
  w  pane     glass     a8d0d0                              window
  g  cube     glass     b8e0d8                              window  greenhouse glass
  o  pillar   timber    6b4e32                              wall
  f  pillar   timber    8a6a44                              decor   fence posts
  p  plant    plant     6f9a3a|8ab04a|9ab83a                decor   crops
  k  cube     steel     c9a227                              decor   mustard trim
  m  machine  steel     4a4a48|55524a                       decor   machinery
  r  cube     rock      6e5a48|7a6450|5f4e3e                wall    rock face
  t  rib      timber    7a5632                              wall    pit props
  c  crystal  crystal   e0b040                              decor   gold seam
  /  ramp     timber    6b4e32                              floor
  u  cube     rock      5f4e3e                              floor

